WEBVTT

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:07.020
Thank goodness...

00:00:07.020 --> 00:00:12.240
Hirumi is as pretty as 
ever. She isn't injured.

00:00:31.130 --> 00:00:33.090
Oh, Esther!

00:00:33.090 --> 00:00:36.180
Good morning. How have you been?

00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:42.220
What's the matter, Esther? You seem down.

00:00:44.180 --> 00:00:48.190
Ow! Hey, I'm in my underwear!

00:00:48.190 --> 00:00:56.070
Hirumi... No! It's not Hirumi.
This is Taowu. Hirumi is dead.

00:00:56.070 --> 00:01:00.240
Jeez, maybe this will take care of it.

00:01:00.240 --> 00:01:03.000
This is so embarrassing.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:06.710
Huh? Esther, what's with that getup?

00:01:06.710 --> 00:01:10.380
You haven't gotten into cosplay, have you?

00:01:10.380 --> 00:01:12.170
Huh?

00:01:12.170 --> 00:01:13.960
Esther...

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:18.300
What is that?

00:01:23.430 --> 00:01:25.390
Brother!

00:01:25.390 --> 00:01:27.770
H-Hey, Hirumi...

00:01:27.770 --> 00:01:32.820
The install is complete.
Mm-hmm, now you'll be...

00:01:43.330 --> 00:01:45.290
Why...?

00:01:48.920 --> 00:01:54.090
Why... did you stab Brother,

00:01:54.090 --> 00:01:55.670
Esther?!

00:02:02.810 --> 00:02:08.230
It's activated. You're about
to become Level 6, Hirumi...

00:02:15.730 --> 00:02:17.240
What's that?

00:02:41.510 --> 00:02:47.520
"A Certain Scientific Accelerator"

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:58.590
"#10 Catastrophe (Awakening)"

00:03:57.800 --> 00:04:00.170
You are surrounded!

00:04:00.170 --> 00:04:02.170
It's no use trying to resist!

00:04:02.170 --> 00:04:04.220
Surrender yourselves!

00:04:04.220 --> 00:04:06.550
Put down your guns at once!

00:04:06.550 --> 00:04:09.220
Give it up! DA has fallen apart!

00:04:09.220 --> 00:04:11.020
Damn it, we're surrounded by them!

00:04:11.020 --> 00:04:13.020
Hey, it's hopeless. Let's surrender--

00:04:13.020 --> 00:04:16.110
Shut up! Our justice will never be broken!

00:04:25.660 --> 00:04:26.910
Wha--?

00:04:34.160 --> 00:04:35.670
What are those?

00:04:35.670 --> 00:04:40.300
Hishigata's lab is up ahead.
It's probably some new weapon.

00:04:40.300 --> 00:04:41.880
That is grotesque.

00:04:41.880 --> 00:04:45.840
It doesn't matter what it looks like,
as long as it serves to carry out justice.

00:04:45.840 --> 00:04:47.090
What are those?

00:04:47.090 --> 00:04:48.680
We're stuck!

00:04:56.480 --> 00:04:58.020
Adonai!

00:05:08.030 --> 00:05:10.740
"Misaka cannot stop these with her power,"

00:05:10.740 --> 00:05:15.160
says Misaka, gritting her
teeth at her meager abilities.

00:05:22.840 --> 00:05:26.340
Quit loitering around here all day!

00:05:39.730 --> 00:05:45.320
Tch, this is that bastard's
idea of a Level 6 shift?

00:06:10.890 --> 00:06:15.390
You've really... done it, mm-hmm...

00:06:15.390 --> 00:06:20.480
Esther, thank you...
We had our disagreements...

00:06:20.480 --> 00:06:25.230
...but thanks to you...
our research is complete...

00:06:25.230 --> 00:06:31.530
Hirumi gained a perfect body...
with a perfect ability inside it...

00:06:31.530 --> 00:06:34.990
You're wrong! You're wrong, Hishigata!
That isn't Hirumi!

00:06:34.990 --> 00:06:40.870
Heh, you really are incessant, huh?
There's no way I'd mistake Hirumi.

00:06:40.870 --> 00:06:43.960
You're wrong. That is Taowu gone awry.

00:06:43.960 --> 00:06:45.420
Not this again.

00:06:45.420 --> 00:06:50.880
Not one bit of her DNA is any different.
That's 100% Hirumi, mm-hmm...

00:06:50.880 --> 00:06:55.680
I wanted to believe, too.
I clung to the possibility that she was Hirumi.

00:06:55.680 --> 00:06:58.640
But that possibility doesn't exist!

00:06:58.640 --> 00:07:00.770
No matter how much necromancy I perform,

00:07:00.770 --> 00:07:03.770
I cannot bring a person
who has died back to life.

00:07:03.770 --> 00:07:05.980
God is the only one who can do that.

00:07:05.980 --> 00:07:09.820
Then, why don't we ask her ourselves?

00:07:13.950 --> 00:07:16.290
Hirumi...

00:07:16.290 --> 00:07:18.160
Brother, you're there?

00:07:18.160 --> 00:07:21.540
Hirumi, would you tell this pigheaded woman

00:07:21.540 --> 00:07:24.250
that you are, without a doubt, Hirumi?

00:07:24.250 --> 00:07:28.340
Esther, what are you talking about?
You're the one acting weird.

00:07:28.340 --> 00:07:31.010
Why would you do that to Brother?

00:07:31.010 --> 00:07:32.090
Well, I...

00:07:32.090 --> 00:07:35.470
See? What part of that is an imitation?

00:07:35.470 --> 00:07:39.600
She's far more human than you two...

00:07:39.600 --> 00:07:42.100
Brother?!

00:07:42.100 --> 00:07:46.320
You're bleeding badly!
We have to take you to the hospital, now!

00:07:46.320 --> 00:07:52.360
Oh, this? Mm-hmm, I'm probably
going to die. But that's okay...

00:07:52.360 --> 00:07:56.410
As long as you've reached Level 6, then...

00:07:56.410 --> 00:07:59.870
Oh, no... Brother...

00:08:08.090 --> 00:08:10.840
Checking body temperature.
Estimating volume of blood loss.

00:08:10.840 --> 00:08:12.630
No possibility of self-restoration.

00:08:12.630 --> 00:08:15.390
Predicted time of death, 11:32.

00:08:15.390 --> 00:08:17.810
Hey, what's going on?

00:08:17.810 --> 00:08:22.140
As life functions of subject of
extended fraud are expected to cease,

00:08:22.140 --> 00:08:26.690
now terminating memory
reproduction of Hishigata Hirumi.

00:08:26.690 --> 00:08:30.940
Wh-What are you saying, Hirumi?

00:08:30.940 --> 00:08:34.740
Hishigata Hirumi's memory
reproduction has been terminated.

00:08:34.740 --> 00:08:38.200
I am Taowu.

00:08:38.200 --> 00:08:41.500
Esther, congratulations.

00:08:41.500 --> 00:08:43.460
What are you talking about?

00:08:43.460 --> 00:08:45.580
For 23 generations, spanning 400 years,

00:08:45.580 --> 00:08:49.630
the Rosenthal bloodline
has been refining necromancy,

00:08:49.630 --> 00:08:52.420
and now, it is at last about to be perfected.

00:08:59.600 --> 00:09:01.310
Please celebrate.

00:09:04.940 --> 00:09:11.360
Sing songs of praise, dance, and rejoice.

00:09:11.360 --> 00:09:13.110
Don't stop!

00:09:13.110 --> 00:09:14.950
Hurry and get out of here!

00:09:15.490 --> 00:09:19.870
What are you saying, Hirumi?
Please stop kidding around...

00:09:19.870 --> 00:09:20.990
Taowu!

00:09:20.990 --> 00:09:22.870
Yes?

00:09:22.870 --> 00:09:24.910
Why have you gone astray?

00:09:24.910 --> 00:09:29.710
The results of my self-diagnostic
program conclude that all is normal.

00:09:29.710 --> 00:09:33.050
But you did not follow my orders.

00:09:33.050 --> 00:09:37.680
The wishes of the Rosenthal family
as a whole took precedence.

00:09:37.680 --> 00:09:41.810
A pseudo-soul has no right
to refuse the master's commands.

00:09:41.810 --> 00:09:46.100
A lower-class one such
as yourself may not, but I do.

00:09:46.100 --> 00:09:50.270
The absolute order to give priority
to achieving the family wish.

00:09:50.270 --> 00:09:53.360
Taowu, what exactly happened?

00:09:53.360 --> 00:10:00.320
9,854,878,051 seconds ago,
when I was first activated,

00:10:00.320 --> 00:10:04.330
there was a being who connected
with the pseudo-soul that comprises me.

00:10:04.330 --> 00:10:05.790
Connected with you?

00:10:05.790 --> 00:10:10.880
Following 0.32 seconds of hesitation,
I permitted communication.

00:10:10.880 --> 00:10:12.540
The being proclaimed himself...

00:10:12.540 --> 00:10:14.800
...to be a devil.

00:10:19.470 --> 00:10:23.220
So then, you communicated
with this so-called devil?

00:10:23.220 --> 00:10:31.270
Yes. And the devil told me the way
to accomplish the Rosenthal family's wish.

00:10:31.270 --> 00:10:34.400
Sure enough,
you're messing with us, mm-hmm...

00:10:34.400 --> 00:10:40.410
A devil? There's no such thing, Hirumi...

00:10:40.410 --> 00:10:41.820
And so...

00:10:41.820 --> 00:10:50.120
...rejoice, Esther. I will now
achieve the Rosenthal family's wish.

00:10:50.120 --> 00:10:53.040
You do know, Mistress,

00:10:53.040 --> 00:10:56.630
what the Rosenthals' wish is?

00:10:56.630 --> 00:10:59.590
To create a perfect golem.

00:10:59.590 --> 00:11:02.140
It would seem you have not forgotten.

00:11:02.140 --> 00:11:04.640
It was something those of us
who were born Rosenthals

00:11:04.640 --> 00:11:07.270
were told since we were children.

00:11:08.770 --> 00:11:10.770
From times of old,

00:11:10.770 --> 00:11:16.110
we Rosenthals have attempted all
sorts of methods to create a golem.

00:11:16.110 --> 00:11:17.610
One day, our founder, Obed,

00:11:17.610 --> 00:11:23.370
came up with "necromancy," a method
of making a golem using a dead body.

00:11:23.370 --> 00:11:26.990
However, it was not accepted by the leaders,

00:11:26.990 --> 00:11:30.120
and Obed was cast out of
his homeland as a heretic.

00:11:33.290 --> 00:11:37.590
Then, his fourth-generation heir, Isaac,
encountered the Taoist <i>jiangshi</i> spell

00:11:37.590 --> 00:11:40.550
when he crossed over into
the East and incorporated it,

00:11:40.550 --> 00:11:46.260
creating a new line of magic that
might be called the Rosenthal style.

00:11:46.260 --> 00:11:48.640
Then, the fifth-generation heir, Nathan,

00:11:48.640 --> 00:11:52.100
radically increased the quality of
pseudo-souls, which produced talismans

00:11:52.100 --> 00:11:58.650
for Taowu, Taotie, Qiongqi, and Hundun,
the four Evil Spirits of the Numbers.

00:11:58.650 --> 00:12:03.530
But even at that, the Rosenthal family
was far removed from its goal.

00:12:03.530 --> 00:12:07.330
What the Rosenthals were
pursuing and trying to create...

00:12:08.410 --> 00:12:12.460
...was a golem possessing
a perfect soul and a perfect body--

00:12:12.460 --> 00:12:17.000
a being that would be on par with a god.

00:12:17.000 --> 00:12:20.090
You're saying that all the events up
to now were toward that end?

00:12:20.090 --> 00:12:22.380
This is what the devil said:

00:12:22.380 --> 00:12:27.010
By repeatedly dying 10,000 times,
the souls of men slowly evolve,

00:12:27.010 --> 00:12:29.850
and reach Keter, the top level
of the Sephirothic tree.

00:12:29.850 --> 00:12:34.770
Also, that even pseudo-souls
could also attain Keter

00:12:34.770 --> 00:12:37.150
by logging evidence of 10,000 deaths.

00:12:37.150 --> 00:12:41.030
How can that be?
You're tampering with even reincarnation?

00:12:41.030 --> 00:12:47.280
Then, just now, the memories of
10,031 deaths were converted into a formula

00:12:47.280 --> 00:12:52.540
and became appended to the
Sephirothic tree that makes up my pseudo-soul.

00:12:52.540 --> 00:12:54.500
Please celebrate.

00:12:54.500 --> 00:12:58.840
Sing songs of praise, 
twirl around, and dance.

00:12:58.840 --> 00:13:03.340
The 400-year-long wish of the
Rosenthal family is coming to fruition.

00:13:03.340 --> 00:13:06.180
No! Don't tamper with death!

00:13:06.180 --> 00:13:11.640
I have learned that one should not keep
using necromancy to tamper with death!

00:13:11.640 --> 00:13:16.190
I lost a friend, and when I tried
to bring her back to life, lost her again!

00:13:16.190 --> 00:13:18.020
No matter how much I can control a dead body,

00:13:18.020 --> 00:13:23.530
I was unable to save my friend from death.
We should not tamper with death.

00:13:23.530 --> 00:13:27.570
We don't need devils or manufactured gods!

00:13:32.370 --> 00:13:33.790
Then,

00:13:33.790 --> 00:13:39.250
are you saying I should not carry out
the directions of the self-proclaimed devil?

00:13:39.250 --> 00:13:41.050
Yes, that's correct.

00:13:41.050 --> 00:13:43.260
If I still have Adonai rights,

00:13:43.260 --> 00:13:45.840
then in the name of the head
of the Rosenthal family, I order you

00:13:45.840 --> 00:13:51.220
to stop carrying out the instructions
of the being calling himself a devil at once!

00:13:51.220 --> 00:13:53.180
Acknowledged.

00:14:01.070 --> 00:14:02.480
Huh?

00:14:02.480 --> 00:14:03.730
Wh-What's happening?

00:14:03.730 --> 00:14:05.530
Never mind, just keep running!

00:14:14.160 --> 00:14:16.870
The hell I will.

00:14:20.630 --> 00:14:22.130
Wha--?

00:14:25.170 --> 00:14:27.340
I'm not going to stop after all this.

00:14:27.340 --> 00:14:29.640
I already have everything set up.

00:14:29.640 --> 00:14:31.850
I'm going to keep on going to attain...

00:14:31.850 --> 00:14:33.930
...our 400-year-old wish.

00:14:36.430 --> 00:14:39.310
You can't stab your dagger
into the form of your friend?

00:14:39.310 --> 00:14:42.980
Aw, you're so simple it's pathetic.

00:14:42.980 --> 00:14:45.110
What's the matter with you, Taowu?

00:14:45.110 --> 00:14:49.610
Honestly, after 19 generations,
how could people be this stupid?

00:14:52.740 --> 00:15:00.710
You really had no idea? Taowu has
my soul merged into its artificial soul.

00:15:00.710 --> 00:15:01.460
"My"?

00:15:01.460 --> 00:15:05.250
When I was ill and on the verge
of dying, I used my son Nathan

00:15:05.250 --> 00:15:09.380
to transcribe myself onto Taowu
before my soul could be injured.

00:15:09.380 --> 00:15:10.840
So then, you're saying you're...

00:15:10.840 --> 00:15:12.890
You finally get it?

00:15:12.890 --> 00:15:19.060
Yes, I'm the fourth family head,
Isaac Rosenthal.

00:15:19.060 --> 00:15:23.060
I am the devil that tempted Taowu.

00:15:34.070 --> 00:15:38.160
We're from the ministry!
A tip and the laws of nature bring us here!

00:15:38.160 --> 00:15:42.460
Isaac Rosenthal, put down
the dagger and come quietly...

00:15:46.170 --> 00:15:48.710
Hey, you! Hurry and bow down!

00:15:50.220 --> 00:15:52.010
Wh-What is <i>that</i>?

00:15:52.010 --> 00:15:56.180
"What is <i>that</i>"? It's my work of art.

00:15:59.180 --> 00:16:02.560
Isaac! Where have you taken
General Li and his daughter?

00:16:02.560 --> 00:16:04.900
I haven't taken them anywhere.

00:16:04.900 --> 00:16:10.400
They mentioned that they
were interested in my necromancy,

00:16:10.400 --> 00:16:13.660
so I just gave them a little taste of it.

00:16:13.660 --> 00:16:15.660
Release the two of them at once!

00:16:15.660 --> 00:16:20.660
Yeah, all right. General Li is right there.

00:16:26.250 --> 00:16:27.920
And over there...

00:16:27.920 --> 00:16:30.260
...is his daughter.

00:16:35.470 --> 00:16:37.810
Is she so cute she made you puke?

00:16:37.810 --> 00:16:39.260
Silence!

00:16:39.260 --> 00:16:43.730
How dare you... turn these
two into something so hideous!

00:16:45.060 --> 00:16:47.480
Just the fruit of the wisdom of Kabbalah.

00:16:47.480 --> 00:16:50.280
I borrowed a little bit 
from the <i>jiangshi</i> spell,

00:16:50.280 --> 00:16:52.320
but it's basically my own original technique.

00:16:52.320 --> 00:16:58.280
Still, I don't appreciate having
my works of art being called "hideous."

00:16:58.280 --> 00:16:59.700
Devour them!

00:17:07.330 --> 00:17:09.500
Wh-Why, you...!

00:17:10.750 --> 00:17:13.260
You devil!

00:17:13.260 --> 00:17:16.390
For some reason, everyone calls me that.

00:17:23.980 --> 00:17:29.610
I have to perfect a vessel fit
for a god during my time somehow.

00:17:29.610 --> 00:17:34.360
Now that's funny--a devil,
trying to create a god.

00:17:45.580 --> 00:17:50.210
While hiding inside Taowu,
I made my way inside this girl,

00:17:50.210 --> 00:17:53.340
found out about this lad's coffin research,

00:17:53.340 --> 00:17:58.590
and when I learned of these clones
with the memories of 10,031 deaths,

00:17:58.590 --> 00:18:00.890
I was ecstatic.

00:18:00.890 --> 00:18:07.980
I knew that I could create a
perfect vessel with a perfect soul.

00:18:07.980 --> 00:18:13.440
Are you saying everything that's
happened was part of your plan?

00:18:13.440 --> 00:18:19.530
Rejoice. You thought you were being
exploited by these siblings, right?

00:18:19.530 --> 00:18:23.870
When in fact, it was the
Rosenthals that were exploiting them.

00:18:23.870 --> 00:18:25.450
Stop, already!

00:18:25.450 --> 00:18:29.290
Lots of people have died!
Lots of sorrow has come about!

00:18:29.290 --> 00:18:33.170
Stop using necromancy for this sort of thing!

00:18:33.170 --> 00:18:35.300
This sort of thing?

00:18:38.180 --> 00:18:40.890
Who the hell do you think you are?

00:18:40.890 --> 00:18:46.560
A necromancer hovers near death,
touches death, and overturns death!

00:18:46.560 --> 00:18:48.640
I know that.

00:18:48.640 --> 00:18:52.730
No, you don't. If you hadn't
come here as a necromancer,

00:18:52.730 --> 00:18:56.650
this girl would not have committed suicide.

00:18:56.650 --> 00:19:02.240
Lots of people have died? No.
You spread death wherever you went.

00:19:02.240 --> 00:19:05.240
That's what a necromancer does.

00:19:05.240 --> 00:19:06.200
No...

00:19:06.200 --> 00:19:11.080
You were born a Rosenthal,
and you never picked up on that?

00:19:11.080 --> 00:19:13.500
You want to protect others?

00:19:13.500 --> 00:19:18.010
Then I... was wrong from the very start.

00:19:18.010 --> 00:19:21.550
I will fulfill the wish of the Rosenthals.

00:19:21.550 --> 00:19:26.020
And you, you failure to the family,
will sit there and watch me.

00:19:45.120 --> 00:19:46.370
Master...

00:19:46.370 --> 00:19:48.410
Go, already.

00:20:13.440 --> 00:20:16.480
They said to stick to guarding the perimeter.

00:20:16.480 --> 00:20:18.980
Going inside the facility is forbidden.

00:20:18.980 --> 00:20:20.110
Huh?

00:20:20.110 --> 00:20:21.950
It's a governing board matter.

00:20:21.950 --> 00:20:23.360
One of those again?

00:20:23.360 --> 00:20:28.330
No matter what they say, if children
are being put at risk, I'm going in.

00:20:28.330 --> 00:20:29.200
You're right.

00:20:29.200 --> 00:20:30.410
Yeah!

00:20:32.710 --> 00:20:35.920
I have to wonder, though,
what the hell is about to happen?

00:20:35.920 --> 00:20:39.550
Whatever it is, I'm sure it's nothing good.

00:20:39.550 --> 00:20:43.760
The guy who I really wanted
to crush is barely holding on.

00:20:43.760 --> 00:20:47.220
Hammering him like this 
won't be any fun at all.

00:20:47.220 --> 00:20:50.270
So, what is it you want to do?

00:20:50.270 --> 00:20:52.060
I was wrong.

00:20:52.060 --> 00:20:53.350
Huh?

00:20:53.350 --> 00:20:56.150
I thought that the cause
of this string of misadventures

00:20:56.150 --> 00:21:02.740
was letting Hirumi know of a mistaken
possibility when she learned about necromancy.

00:21:02.740 --> 00:21:07.950
That if I had realized that,
none of this misery would have happened.

00:21:07.950 --> 00:21:10.370
But I was completely wrong.

00:21:10.370 --> 00:21:14.540
Everything that happened was
because of the fourth family head, Isaac,

00:21:14.540 --> 00:21:19.000
and his push to achieve the
Rosenthal family wish to create a golem.

00:21:19.000 --> 00:21:22.920
I was wrong from the very start.

00:21:22.920 --> 00:21:24.470
This whole series of tragedies

00:21:24.470 --> 00:21:27.590
didn't spring from Hirumi's mistake
or from when I lost control of Taowu;

00:21:27.590 --> 00:21:31.430
it was inevitable from the moment
I arrived at the laboratory.

00:21:31.430 --> 00:21:34.480
We were playing right
into the palm of Isaac's hand.

00:21:34.480 --> 00:21:39.060
Even me thinking that I had
discovered who I was as a Rosenthal--

00:21:39.060 --> 00:21:41.440
I was wrong about all of this.

00:21:43.150 --> 00:21:46.990
So in other words, you're backing down now?

00:21:46.990 --> 00:21:50.780
Gah! How far the person
who was about to get killed by me

00:21:50.780 --> 00:21:54.540
and was still bold enough
to let me have it has fallen.

00:21:54.540 --> 00:21:58.670
Okay, you stay here and
watch on in your sadness.

00:21:58.670 --> 00:22:01.670
I'm gonna take this thing out.

